      "factId": "washing-machine-draft-002",
      "topicId": "washing_machine",
      "factText": "洗衣机的 IMEF 会把洗涤用电、热水、衣物残余水分带来的烘干能耗和低功耗状态一起计算；数值越高代表越节能。",
      "sourceIds": ["src-energy-star-clothes-washer-criteria"],
      "riskLevel": "general",
      "reviewStatus": "draft"
    },
    {
      "factId": "washing-machine-draft-003",
      "topicId": "washing_machine",
      "factText": "IWF 用每次洗涤的加权用水量除以滚筒容量，让不同容量的洗衣机可以比较用水效率；这个数值越低越省水。",
      "sourceIds": ["src-energy-star-clothes-washer-criteria"],
      "riskLevel": "general",
      "reviewStatus": "draft"
    },
    {
      "factId": "washing-machine-draft-004",
